OL,3,GNEWSA'Disrespek' as councillors say no
OL,4,Ato Ali G statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition calling for a landmark
OL,7,Fcelebrating Ali G in a Surrey town has
OL,8,Fbeen thrown out by councillors.
OL,10,FResidents of Staines launched the
OL,11,Fpetition in light of the fictional
OL,12,Fcharacter's upcoming new film.
OL,14,FAlex Balkan, who started the petition,
OL,15,Ftold BBC Radio Surrey the attraction
OL,16,Fwould have brought a "big economic
OL,17,Fbenefit" to the area.
OL,19,FA Spelthourne Borough Council
OL,20,Fspokesperson said after debating the
OL,21,Fproposal on Tuesday, councillors
OL,22,Fdecided not to support it at this time.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
